OL,4,CDelayed leisure centre refurbishment   
OL,5,Cto cost #8.7m                          
OL,6,GMore than #8m is to be spent on        
OL,7,Grefurbishing a leisure centre with no  
OL,8,Gdate set as to when it will reopen,    
OL,9,GHull City Council has said.            
OL,11,FEnnerdale Leisure Centre shut in May   
OL,12,F2025 and was originally expected to    
OL,13,Freopen this year.                      
OL,15,FHowever, the council previously said   
OL,16,Fit would remain closed until 2027      
OL,17,F"after multiple sections of the        
OL,18,Fswimming pool pipework were found in a 
OL,19,Fsignificantly poorer condition than    
OL,20,Finitially expected".                   
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
