OL,4,CDrones could catch illegal off-road    
OL,5,Cdrivers                                
OL,6,GThermal imaging drones could catch     
OL,7,Gillegal off-road drivers who damage    
OL,8,Gsensitive moorland habitats in the     
OL,9,GYorkshire Dales.                       
OL,11,FThe Yorkshire Dales Moorland Group     
OL,12,Fsaid it was stepping up efforts to     
OL,13,Ftrack down offenders and prosecute     
OL,14,Fthem as damage to moorland habitats    
OL,15,Fcontinues to grow.                     
OL,17,FOver the past two years, the group has 
OL,18,Freported vehicles tearing up peatland, 
OL,19,Fdestroying sensitive vegetation and    
OL,20,Fdisturbing wildlife.                   
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
