OL,4,CCouncil hopes training hub will        
OL,5,C'inspire' learners                     
OL,6,GA new training hub will help young     
OL,7,Gpeople and adults in Hull to gain      
OL,8,Gemployment or change careers, the city 
OL,9,Gcouncil has said.                      
OL,11,FThe Centre for Learning, which is      
OL,12,Fbased at the former Trinity House      
OL,13,FAcademy in George Street, will         
OL,14,Fofficially open later following a      
OL,15,Frefurbishment costing more than #5m.   
OL,17,FAccording to the council, the centre   
OL,18,Fwill provide a "single and accessible  
OL,19,Flocation", offering post-16 courses    
OL,20,Fand qualifications, as well as         
OL,21,Fapprenticeships and adult education.   
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
